WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.130
- You ready?

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:03.760
Yeah, Ticketmaster.

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:04.760
All right, I'm on right now,

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.600
they go on sale in three minutes.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.430
(sigh)

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:10.770
Three, two...

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:13.940
One.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:17.230
(frantic music)

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:19.020
No tickets available?

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:19.730
Refresh.

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:20.900
Refresh.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.440
Did you find any?

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.280
No it said, it said no tickets available.

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:25.110
Yeah, get it!

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:26.110
How much?

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:27.950
Five hundred dollars?

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:28.700
No.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:30.160
Change the quantity from two to one.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.160
We'll both try getting singles,

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:32.200
it doesn't matter if
they're next to each other,

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:32.693
just try to get it--

00:00:32.693 --> 00:00:33.040
What?

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:33.863
Goodbye, goodbye.

00:00:33.863 --> 00:00:35.700
What is wrong with my wi-fi?

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.630
Mom, turn the wi-fi back on!

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:40.250
What kind of CAPTCHA is this?

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.500
Is this in a different
language, what's that even say?

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.550
How are there no seats available?

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:48.220
Refresh, refresh,
refresh, refresh, refresh.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:49.660
You're doing your best here, Ben.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:51.390
You're doing your best, focus.

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:55.110
(matrix-style music)

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.060
I got 'em.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.530
(laughs)

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:04.940
Oh my...

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:08.530
Credit card declined.

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:09.570
But I did everything right.

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:10.770
No!

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:11.790
(screams)

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:15.620
(happy music)

